# Reviewed exceptions to `build/wheels.py audit` (release.sh refuses a release while any pinned wheel has an advisory
# that isn't named here). One per line: the OSV id (GHSA-…, PYSEC-…, CVE-…) as the audit prints it, then ONE line saying
# why it doesn't apply to Tin Hat Server (which code path, why we don't use it). An entry without a reason is refused;
